    "blog_name": "pgxn",
    "body": "<h1>New PGXN Mastodon Account</h1><p>Sadly, the home of the PGXN Mastodon bot for the last two years, <a href=\"https://botsin.space/\">botsin.space</a> is shutting down. I&rsquo;ve created a new account, <a href=\"https://mastodon.social/@pgxn\"></a><a class=\"tumblelog\" href=\"https://tmblr.co/MjhKH7HY9hCsIHz7Wo7CIMg\">@pgxn</a>@mastodon.social and moved all the followers. Please give it a follow if you didn&rsquo;t follow the old account, and stay up-to-date on the latest PGXN releases!</p>",
